  "rendering": "MenuTabBar.MenuTabButton: selected/unselected crossed with hover-or-focus picks four original sprites. Native130x24 nine-slice has borders2/2/2/0 and tiled interior. Selected fill uses original menu_background at x+2,y+2 to right-2,bottom, texture period32. Selected underline min(font.width,label pane width-4), x=floor((width-lineWidth)/2), y=22. Text y8 selected/y10 unselected, white or disabledA0 with native shadow. Native scrolling helper is sampled under a temporarily pinned/restored original time source. List width min(400,outer)-28, per-tab even rounding after integer division, left margin rounded to even. Original sound is emitted by TabManager only when selection changes."
